[I] Tab Window Manager for the X Window System

[T] twm is the classic window manager of the X Window System. It provides
[T] titlebars, shaped windows, several forms of icon management,
[T] user-defined macro functions, click-to-type and pointer-driven keyboard
[T] focus and user-specified key and pointer button bindings.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/app/twm

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/x11
[F] CROSS

[L] OpenSource
[V] 1.0.13.1

[D] e83cf6320ff9be661ede7004a9237a615de2b01d22cf0a6d04f8e894 twm-1.0.13.1.tar.xz https://xorg.freedesktop.org/releases/individual/app/

. package/*/*/modular-x-conf.in

hook_add postmake 5 "register_wm twm TWM $bindir/twm"
